WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
A retired server is opened and its board is inspected.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
A test shows whether the board still works.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
If it works, it can go into another server or become a spare.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
The damaged cable comes out of the retired equipment.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
A specialist sorts it and prepares it for treatment.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
Some of the copper can be used again as material.
